<p class=3D"mb-2 last:mb-0">As you iterate on Skills, pay attention to how =
Claude actually uses them in practice. Watch for:</p>
<ul class=3D"list-none pl-8 [&amp;_ul]:pl-8 [&amp;_ol]:pl-8 mb-4">
<li class=3D"mb-2 last:mb-0 relative before:absolute before:left-[-2rem] be=
fore:w-6 before:text-center [ul&gt;&amp;]:before:content-['=E2=80=A2'] [ol&=
gt;&amp;]:before:content-[counter(item)'.'] [ol&gt;&amp;]:[counter-incremen=
t:item]"><strong class=3D"font-semibold">Unexpected exploration paths:</str=
ong> Does Claude read files in an order you didn't anticipate? This might i=
ndicate your structure isn't as intuitive as you thought</li>
<li class=3D"mb-2 last:mb-0 relative before:absolute before:left-[-2rem] be=
fore:w-6 before:text-center [ul&gt;&amp;]:before:content-['=E2=80=A2'] [ol&=
gt;&amp;]:before:content-[counter(item)'.'] [ol&gt;&amp;]:[counter-incremen=
t:item]"><strong class=3D"font-semibold">Missed connections:</strong> Does =
Claude fail to follow references to important files? Your links might need =
to be more explicit or prominent</li>
<li class=3D"mb-2 last:mb-0 relative before:absolute before:left-[-2rem] be=
fore:w-6 before:text-center [ul&gt;&amp;]:before:content-['=E2=80=A2'] [ol&=
gt;&amp;]:before:content-[counter(item)'.'] [ol&gt;&amp;]:[counter-incremen=
t:item]"><strong class=3D"font-semibold">Overreliance on certain sections:<=
