<p class=3D"mb-2 last:mb-0">When the user asks about revenue, Claude reads =
SKILL.md, sees the reference to <code class=3D"relative inline bg-bg-300 px=
-2 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words box-decoration-clone">refer=
ence/finance.md</code>, and invokes bash to read just that file. The sales.=
md and product.md files remain on the filesystem, consuming zero context to=
kens until needed. This filesystem-based model is what enables progressive =
disclosure. Claude can navigate and selectively load exactly what each task=
 requires.</p>
